          <p class="t65-disclaimer-note">
            <em>Educational decision support only.</em> Individual Medicare circumstances vary. Always verify specific coverage details with Medicare.gov (1-800-633-4227), SSA.gov, or your employer benefits administrator before making enrollment changes.
          </p>
